@host = http://localhost:5107

### Sign in (copy accessToken into @token below)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "login": "admin", "password": "Admin@12345" }

###
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Who am I, which campuses and permissions
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Campuses and the current academic year
GET {{host}}/api/campuses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/academic-years/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Programmes and classes
GET {{host}}/api/structure/programmes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Website: options for the admission form (anonymous)
GET {{host}}/api/public/admission/options

### Website: enquiry form (anonymous) — replace the ids from the call above
POST {{host}}/api/public/admission/enquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "campusId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "yearGroupId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "childName": "Ayaan Rahman",
  "guardianName": "Karim Rahman",
  "guardianPhone": "01711000000",
  "message": "Is there a seat in Year 5?"
}

### Admission pipeline
GET {{host}}/api/admission/enquiries?stage=Enquiry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/admission/enquiries/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Global search
GET {{host}}/api/search?q=Rahman
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Students
GET {{host}}/api/students?search=Rahman
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Excel import template
GET {{host}}/api/students/import/template
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Audit trail and chain verification
GET {{host}}/api/audit?pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/audit/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bangla / Hijri / lakh-crore helpers
GET {{host}}/api/localization/today?amount=660000
